    "<h4 style=\"color:rgb(150,75,0)\">Let's create the UNet model:</h4>\n",
    "<ul> <li><span style=\"color:rgb(10,10,10)\">The main model is in the class <i><b>UNet</b></i>; however, there are several auxiliary classes.</span>"
