    "<b>Exercise 2.7. [3 Points]</b>\n",
    "\n",
    "<b>Goal:</b> Now, we use the trained model to segment the <i><b>retina blood vessels</b><i>  based on <i><b>unseen data</b><i> from the <i><b>test subset</b><i>.\n",
